<title>USA: Chicago Dock date for vote on merger.</title>
<headline>Chicago Dock date for vote on merger.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Dock and Canal Trust said on Friday that it set January 9, 1997 as the special meeting date to vote on its proposed merger with Newsweb Corp.</p>
<p>It said November 11 is the record date.</p>
<p>The trust has signed a definitive agreement with Newsweb Corp for the purchase of all outstanding shares of Chicago Dock for $21 per share in cash.</p>
<p>Chicago Dock and canal Trust is a real estate investment trust engaged mainly in acquiring and holding real estate and interests in real estate for investment.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
